# Envs
*.env*
# ...except templates -- meant to be committed (placeholders only, no
# secrets); *.env* above was silently blocking these from ever landing in
# git (found 2026-08-13: agent/README.md referenced a .env.example that
# had never actually been committed because of this exact pattern).
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# Notes
prompts/
journal.txt
/notes/*
docs/notes/

# Prototypes 
*_proto

# Site Page
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
*.bkp 

# Logs 
*.log


# Data 
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.json* 
*.parquet
aeroflux/data/*
# !aeroflux/aeroflux_parser/data/*


# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.ipynb_checkpoints
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/*
.pytest_cache*
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

!agent/data/*.json
!agent/eval/*.json
assets/videos/*.mp4
